<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>家长需要关注什么</title>
<style>
  * {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  body {
    font-family: "SimSun", "STSong", "Songti SC", serif;
    background: #f5f0e8;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 20px;
  }

  .container {
    width: 700px;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  /* Header Section */
  .header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #5a8a7a, #4a7a6a, #3d6b5c);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 40px 30px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    min-height: 220px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .header::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background: 
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 50%, rgba(100,160,140,0.3) 0%, transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 30%, rgba(80,140,120,0.2) 0%, transparent 50%);
  }

  .deer-placeholder {
    position: absolute;
    left: 30px;
    top: 20px;
    width: 200px;
    height: 180px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .deer-placeholder svg {
    width: 180px;
    height: 170px;
  }

  .header-text {
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    margin-left: 180px;
  }

  .header-text h1 {
    font-size: 36px;
    color: #f0e8d0;
    letter-spacing: 8px;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-shadow: 1px 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  }

  .header-text .subtitle {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #c8d8c8;
    letter-spacing: 12px;
    margin-top: 15px;
  }

  .seal {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 15px;
    left: 20px;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    background: #c0392b;
    border-radius: 3px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: white;
    font-size: 10px;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  /* Content Sections */
  .section {
    background: #faf8f4;
    border: 2px solid #d4c9a8;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 30px 25px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .section-seal {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 10px;
    left: 15px;
    width: 25px;
    height: 25px;
    background: #c0392b;
    border-radius: 3px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: white;
    font-size: 9px;
  }

  /* Circular Center Design */
  .circle-center {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 140px;
    height: 140px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 4px solid #8b7355;
    background: #f5f0e0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 2;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #d4c9a8, inset 0 0 0 3px #d4c9a8;
  }

  .circle-center::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    width: 120px;
    height: 120px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid #a0896a;
  }

  .circle-center .circle-text {
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    font-size: 22px;
    color: #5a7a6a;
    letter-spacing: 6px;
    font-weight: bold;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Lattice pattern around circle */
  .lattice-ring {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 170px;
    height: 170px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 3px solid #8b7355;
    z-index: 1;
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  /* Points Layout */
  .points-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
  }

  .point {
    padding: 10px 15px;
  }

  .point-label {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #6a9a8a;
    color: white;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 28px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .point-content {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #333;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .point-content .highlight {
    color: #c0392b;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .point-content strong {
    color: #2c3e50;
  }

  /* Bottom section specific */
  .bottom-points {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 25px 40px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
    padding: 10px 0;
  }

  .bottom-point {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 8px 0;
  }

  .bottom-point .point-label {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .bottom-point .point-text {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #333;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  /* Decorative elements */
  .water-decoration {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 30px;
    width: 200px;
    height: 40px;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  /* Responsive adjustments */
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .header-text h1 {
      font-size: 24px;
    }
    .header-text {
      margin-left: 0;
    }
    .deer-placeholder {
      display: none;
    }
    .points-grid, .bottom-points {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .circle-center {
      width: 100px;
      height: 100px;
    }
    .circle-center .circle-text {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  }

  /* Section divider */
  .divider {
    height: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8b7355, #a0896a, #8b7355);
    margin: 5px 0 20px 0;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .section-title-area {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="header">
    <div class="deer-placeholder">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 200 180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <!-- Deer body -->
        <ellipse cx="110" cy="100" rx="45" ry="28" fill="#f5e6c8" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <!-- Deer neck -->
        <path d="M 75 85 Q 65 60 70 45" fill="none" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <path d="M 75 85 Q 65 60 70 45" fill="none" stroke="#f5e6c8" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <!-- Deer head -->
        <ellipse cx="68" cy="40" rx="18" ry="14" fill="#f5e6c8" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <!-- Antlers -->
        <path d="M 62 30 Q 55 10 45 5 M 55 15 Q 50 8 42 10" fill="none" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <path d="M 68 28 Q 70 8 75 2 M 72 15 Q 78 8 82 10" fill="none" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <!-- Legs -->
        <line x1="85" y1="120" x2="80" y2="155" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <line x1="100" y1="122" x2="98" y2="158" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <line x1="130" y1="118" x2="135" y2="152" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <line x1="145" y1="115" x2="150" y2="148" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <!-- Tail -->
        <path d="M 155 95 Q 165 90 162 85" fill="none" stroke="#c9a96e" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <!-- Spots -->
        <circle cx="100" cy="95" r="4" fill="#e8a87c" opacity="0.6"/>
        <circle cx="115" cy="90" r="3" fill="#e8a87c" opacity="0.6"/>
        <circle cx="108" cy="105" r="3.5" fill="#e8a87c" opacity="0.6"/>
        <!-- Water/ground -->
        <path d="M 20 155 Q 60 145 100 155 Q 140 165 180 155" fill="none" stroke="#7ab8a0" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.5"/>
        <path d="M 30 162 Q 70 152 110 162 Q 150 172 190 162" fill="none" stroke="#7ab8a0" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.4"/>
        <path d="M 10 168 Q 50 158 90 168 Q 130 178 170 168" fill="none" stroke="#7ab8a0" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.3"/>
        <!-- Green patches -->
        <ellipse cx="50" cy="150" rx="30" ry="8" fill="#7ab8a0" opacity="0.3"/>
        <ellipse cx="140" cy="148" rx="25" ry="7" fill="#7ab8a0" opacity="0.25"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="header-text">
      <h1>家长需要关注什么</h1>
      <div class="subtitle">章 · 节 · 肆</div>
    </div>
    <div class="seal">印</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Section 1: 成绩怎么看 -->
  <div class="section" style="min-height: 320px;">
    <div class="lattice-ring"></div>
    <div class="circle-center">
      <div class="circle-text">成绩怎么看</div>
    </div>

    <div class="points-grid">
      <div class="point" style="grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1;">
        <div class="point-label">壹</div>
        <div class="point-content">
          看单科成绩<br>
          分析优势与劣势科目
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="point" style="grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1;">
        <div class="point-label">肆</div>
        <div class="point-content">
          分析题错：<br>
          是遗憾丢分？是模糊丢分？<br>
          是不会做丢分？<br>
          <span class="highlight">策略</span>：消除遗憾、纠正模糊、力争突破
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="point" style="grid-column: 1; grid-row: 2;">
        <div class="point-label">贰</div>
        <div class="point-content">
          看进步<br>
          横向整体水平<br>
          纵向看进退情况
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="point" style="grid-column: 2; grid-row: 2;">
        <div class="point-label">伍</div>
        <div class="point-content">
          分析考试技巧<br>
          策略是否得当？<br>
          是否按标准答题？<br>
          是否摆正心态？
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="point" style="grid-column: 1; grid-row: 3;">
        <div class="point-label">叁</div>
        <div class="point-content">
          分析错题
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-seal">印</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Section 2: 家长五不要 -->
  <div class="section" style="min-height: 300px;">
    <div class="lattice-ring"></div>
    <div class="circle-center">
      <div class="circle-text">家长五不要</div>
    </div>

    <div class="bottom-points">
      <div class="bottom-point" style="grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1;">
        <div class="point-label">壹</div>
        <div class="point-text">不要过度焦虑</div>
      </div>

      <div class="bottom-point" style="grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1;">
        <div class="point-label">肆</div>
        <div class="point-text">不要过度唠叨</div>
      </div>

      <div class="bottom-point" style="grid-column: 1; grid-row: 2;">
        <div class="point-label">贰</div>
        <div class="point-text">不要过度关注孩子</div>
      </div>

      <div class="bottom-point" style="grid-column: 2; grid-row: 2;">
        <div class="point-label">伍</div>
        <div class="point-text">不要盲目攀比和迷信</div>
      </div>

      <div class="bottom-point" style="grid-column: 1; grid-row: 3;">
        <div class="point-label">叁</div>
        <div class="point-text">不要给孩子过高的期望</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-seal">印</div>
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
